    Press: milestone, done, 1, 1
    Release: milestone, done, 2, 2
    Press: milestone, done, 3, 3
    Release: milestone, done, 4, 4
    section ㅤㅤ
    A1: 0, 1s
    A2: active, 1, 1s
    A1: 2, 1s
    A2: active, 3, 1s
    A1: 4, 1s
